      "content": "The exhaustion you're feeling is completely understandable when you've been fighting an unwinnable battle. It's true that the future can look bleak when you've seen how easily good intentions are crushed. If the fight feels too big, maybe the focus needs to shift from winning the system to simply finding a way to survive it, even if that means stepping away from the arena entirely. There are paths to finding peace outside of the toxic cycle you've described.",
